{"title":"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/1697835a3b76887ced69a431157bf8811a17ac64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2-(-2)^{-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"19\" />&#160;?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/9/6d9e89ee87c17cec9d0aafaeccb8ee750df94434.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } -2\\qquad\\textbf{(B) } \\dfrac{1}{16}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } \\dfrac{7}{4}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } \\dfrac{9}{4}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"396\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/729016f58de8523e3d190726c115673a68f69d05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2-(-2)^{-2}=2-\\frac{1}{(-2)^2}=2-\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{8}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{7}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"416\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span><